{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/982bc53b50182bb84a37992810c94c6a.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/982bc53b50182bb84a37992810c94c6a.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/982bc53b50182bb84a37992810c94c6a.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>\u200bScarred Steel is a brutal, solo tactical RPG, inspired by the game Heads Will Roll Reforged, where victory is never clean. <br><br>As a betrayed commander, you must dismantle the corrupt Council of Seven through unforgiving turn-based duels. <br><br>In this world, you don't just lose health, you gain scars that change how you play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200bTactical Combat with Real Weight</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/fb78b9ad3ba9114798a6b15043f2cbfa.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/fb78b9ad3ba9114798a6b15043f2cbfa.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/fb78b9ad3ba9114798a6b15043f2cbfa.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every swing of your blade is a gamble. <br><br>Manage your Stamina and Balance to keep the advantage during combat.<br><br>Target body parts to improve hit chance, damage and balance damage.<br><br>Overconfidence in fights is the true killer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200bThe Anatomy of Failure</h2><br>Injuries gained such as broken bones, bloodloss, and swelling can persist through your journey depending on severity.<br>\u200b<br>Sometimes you'll have to fight with injuries that debuff you from the beginning.<br><br>Success isn't about finishing a fight flawlessly, it's about surviving.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Perfect Starts</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/00225869f8b9a1df674bf9936c5b3521.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/00225869f8b9a1df674bf9936c5b3521.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/00225869f8b9a1df674bf9936c5b3521.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every run begins with a draft of three randomized survivors.<br><br>Here you manage a survivor with unique traits, limited gear, and starting flaws.<br><br>\u200bEvery new run will give you different trade-offs to make when selecting the right character for you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Equipment Carefully</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/c18585f5372968f887eeeae76e8919c9.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/c18585f5372968f887eeeae76e8919c9.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/c18585f5372968f887eeeae76e8919c9.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Heavier equipment makes you easier to hit, lighter equipment leaves you more exposed and weapon types are unique from one another.<br><br>Discover which equipment fits your play style, find better equipment and repair them when they lose durability.<br><br>Make the best with what you can find.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dismantle the Council</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/33ed82b08e966b18de6c398aa9299964.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/33ed82b08e966b18de6c398aa9299964.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/33ed82b08e966b18de6c398aa9299964.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate a fractured Kingdom across a strategic map where time is your greatest enemy.<br><br>\u200bTrack down The Council Of Seven, each member possessing unique passive debuffs and decrees.<br>\u200b<br>The Council\u2019s influence spreads overtime. Move carefully to avoid patrols, but move quickly before the land collapses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Road to Revenge Begins Here.</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/7edeee26ec60b51a47e9071fe6150b82.poster.avif?t=1773915178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/7edeee26ec60b51a47e9071fe6150b82.webm?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952140/extras/7edeee26ec60b51a47e9071fe6150b82.mp4?t=1773915178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Before you can reach the Council of Seven, you must survive the man who started it all. The Baron<br><br>\u200bCan you navigate the ruins, endure the injuries, and claim your first taste of vengeance? <br><br>Download the Demo and see if you have what it takes to survive the prologue.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddd2\ufe0f A Note from the Developer</h2><br>Scarred Steel was built solo using AI-assisted tools for its visuals, music, and code.<br><br><strong>Full Transparency:</strong> I have included a 3-minute video in the media gallery (next to the trailer) detailing exactly how AI was used during development and why I use AI.<br><br><strong>Play the Demo First:</strong> I encourage everyone to play the free demo before purchasing. I want you to judge the game based on its mechanics and &quot;feel&quot; to ensure it\u2019s the right fit for you.<br><br>If you\u2019re interested in the development process, you can follow the journey through devlogs on YouTube.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Ground Accepts Him","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/8fc4242abe47ef5934d4e72c0cd74e28c7b5a3ab.jpg"},{"name":"No Clean Victories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/401d4f52db3699a7c29b0126e32a51d36f2a8860.jpg"},{"name":"Grounded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/5259b72c5bd951dd85334a46203f0114e84a3c0b.jpg"},{"name":"Still Standing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/09eeb24755b7067b3cb186b7ada3cd041d91343e.jpg"},{"name":"Mercy is Remembered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/6f3c8a43ad304e6d64eabb8c613016a1608f4012.jpg"},{"name":"No Loose Ends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/de27b9f224057fcecbe5cb649f7f1067a0cc6f8e.jpg"},{"name":"For The King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3952140/04481024ac09235c5ace39562aef9fd7b03